    "chunk_text": "Terram quoque duorum aratruum in locis nominatis illic \u00f0\u00e6t Sui\u00f0hunincg lond \u00e6t Grafon aea. Duas possessiunculas et tertiam dimediam, id est in nostra loquella \u00f0ridda half haga. \u00c6rest on easthealfe betwynan leage & elmanstede swa ofer sc\u00e6t. O\u00fe st\u00e6nincgmearce, swa andlang dices west on burhrode. Ofer burhrode west on boddesham. \u00deanon nor\u00f0 east on burhstr\u00e6te. Andlang str\u00e6te nor\u00f0 on denewarafeld. East on str\u00e6te on \u00fe ealde \u00ferymyrce lehwara, and denewara, and elmes stedes. Swa dic sceade\u00f0 on burhrode..",
